e" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Rename Pic 1.html to education.jpg</span></code></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">File size: </span><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">2 Bytes</span></span></p></div></div></li></ul><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">That means you renamed the HTML file instead of uploading an actual image.</span></p><h3 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Step 1 — Upload the real NJIT picture</span></h3><ol class="List-rH8nmc" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="number" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Find the NJIT picture on your computer.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Right-click the picture and choose </span><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Save image as</span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run"> if you haven't saved it yet.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Save it as </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">education.jpg</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run"> (choose JPEG format).</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Go back to your GitHub </span><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">images</span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run"> folder.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Click </span><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Add file → Upload files</span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Upload the real </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">education.jpg</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Commit the change, replacing the existing file if GitHub offers that option.</span></p></div></div></li></ol><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Do not rename an HTML file to JPG.</span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run"> That doesn't turn it into a picture.</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">When you finish, click </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">education.jpg</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run"> in GitHub. You should see the actual NJIT photo, not a line of text.</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Send me that screenshot, and we'll move to the next step.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="contents"></div></div></div></div></div></div><span hidden=""></span></div></div><div class="actionRow-nqqZbm mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full electron:rounded-md text-tertiary not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-primary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-primary-ghost-hover border-transparent electron:p-1 button-icon flex items-center justify-center p-0.5" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-xs"><path d="M13.468 11.1216C13.468 10.4107 13.468 9.91717 13.4367 9.53369C13.4137 9.25191 13.3758 9.0622 13.3244 8.91846L13.2687 8.78858C13.1148 8.48652 12.8803 8.23344 12.593 8.05713L12.466 7.98584C12.308 7.90546 12.0963 7.84854 11.7209 7.81787C11.3374 7.78656 10.8439 7.78662 10.133 7.78662H7.29999C6.58895 7.78662 6.09562 7.78654 5.7121 7.81787C5.43015 7.84091 5.24064 7.87872 5.09686 7.93018L4.96698 7.98584C4.66487